              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima naabagira nti: Nimureeba akabi aku turimu, Yerusaalemu oku ebaire amatongo, n'amarembo gaayo oku gahiire. Mwije twombekye orugo rwa Yerusaalemu, turekye kuguma nitushekyererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi naabateekyerereza oku omukono gwa Ruhanga wangye gwambereire murungi, kandi n'ebi omugabe yangambiire. Baagira bati: Ka twimukye, twombekye. Batyo baayeteera ebinyomyo kukora omurimo ogwo omurungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
