            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Sanibalati Omuhoroni na Tobila omuhuuku Omuamoni, na Geshemu Omuharabu, ku baakihuriire, baatushekyerera, baatugaya nibagira bati: Mbwenu eki nimukora ki? Nimwenda kugomera omugabe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.19"
            ]
          }
